decomposition on a G1 standing and walking, to support the cross-morphology claim the introduction
leans on.</p>

<p class="noind"><strong>A.4 Single-joint hardware bench.</strong> One motor, a torque load and a
current probe, to verify the 3.2 N&middot;m crossover under injected out-of-band command power.</p>

